WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.840
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.920 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:54.040 --> 01:55.920
- What are you doing?
- Come with me!

01:59.960 --> 02:01.000
Little Immortal Criminal.

02:10.680 --> 02:12.240
Chang…

02:13.640 --> 02:14.880
Lord Changheng.

02:14.960 --> 02:16.120
Lord Changheng, don't kill me.

02:16.600 --> 02:17.920
How bold.

02:18.000 --> 02:19.640
You escaped from prison.

02:20.320 --> 02:22.360
You should be executed
according to the law.

02:33.920 --> 02:35.240
Changheng…

02:37.600 --> 02:38.440
Orchid.

02:38.520 --> 02:41.600
You know that the criminal is with you,
but you didn't report it.

02:41.680 --> 02:43.160
And you hid him in Arbiter Hall!

02:43.240 --> 02:44.800
I…

02:44.880 --> 02:45.960
Stop.

02:46.560 --> 02:47.760
I'm very disappointed in you.

02:55.600 --> 02:56.760
No!

03:06.600 --> 03:07.720
This is

03:08.760 --> 03:10.640
the feeling of fear.

03:21.880 --> 03:23.760
It has been so long since I felt this.

03:31.160 --> 03:32.520
Good thing it was a dream.

04:11.040 --> 04:12.240
Wake up.

04:14.880 --> 04:17.120
Let me sleep for another 7.5 minutes.

04:17.200 --> 04:19.160
It's already 5 a.m.

04:19.240 --> 04:21.959
I want to sleep more.

04:22.920 --> 04:25.720
Get up quickly and fix the Destiny Book.

04:25.800 --> 04:27.440
Leave me alone!

04:28.000 --> 04:29.400
If you feel bored in the morning,

04:29.480 --> 04:31.800
go to the greenhouse
and count all my flowers.

04:31.880 --> 04:34.280
Let me sleep in peace, all right?

04:35.200 --> 04:36.600
I have no time to waste with you.

04:36.680 --> 04:37.520
Now…

05:06.360 --> 05:07.280
One.

05:08.800 --> 05:10.080
Two.

05:12.320 --> 05:13.200
Three.

05:14.040 --> 05:15.360
What's going on?

05:16.000 --> 05:18.400
What black magic
did this Little Flower Spirit do?

05:22.600 --> 05:23.920
If you feel bored in the morning,

05:24.000 --> 05:26.280
go to the greenhouse
and count all my flowers.

05:26.360 --> 05:29.160
Let me sleep in peace, all right?

05:30.640 --> 05:31.600
Nine.

05:32.720 --> 05:33.640
Ten.

05:36.080 --> 05:37.040
Eleven.

05:37.120 --> 05:38.280
Twelve.

05:41.920 --> 05:42.840
Fourteen.

05:42.920 --> 05:44.200
Fifteen.

05:45.880 --> 05:46.720
Shangque.

05:47.880 --> 05:48.800
Shangque!

05:52.640 --> 05:54.040
My lord, what can I do for you?

05:54.880 --> 05:56.040
Fifteen.

05:56.120 --> 05:57.480
Sixteen.

05:59.240 --> 06:00.440
Seventeen.

06:03.760 --> 06:05.160
My lord, are you…

06:08.560 --> 06:09.440
counting flowers?

06:10.600 --> 06:11.560
Why are you doing this?

06:13.920 --> 06:16.120
I'm meditating

06:16.880 --> 06:17.960
to recuperate my vitality.

06:18.040 --> 06:19.280
You're indeed my lord.

06:19.360 --> 06:20.640
Your cultivation
has reached the state of perfection,

06:20.720 --> 06:22.320
but you still won't slack off.

06:22.400 --> 06:23.480
Under your rule,

06:23.560 --> 06:25.560
you can revive Cangyan Sea
and unify the three realms

06:25.640 --> 06:26.920
in no time.

06:29.360 --> 06:30.720
I remember that the Xilan Tribe

06:30.800 --> 06:32.640
recorded all the secrets

06:32.720 --> 06:34.360
in the Xilan Book.

06:34.440 --> 06:37.120
The method of deciphering
the Xilan Holy Seal should be in it.

06:37.200 --> 06:39.320
Do you know where the Xilan Book is now?

06:39.400 --> 06:40.280
I know.

06:40.360 --> 06:42.200
The Xilan Book was in Yunmeng Lake
back then

06:42.280 --> 06:43.440
and our tribe found it.

06:43.520 --> 06:45.920
Now it is heavily guarded
in the secret cabinet of our tribe.

06:46.000 --> 06:47.080
In the past 30,000 years, I--

06:47.160 --> 06:49.440
Then get it now.

06:52.320 --> 06:53.160
Hurry!

06:53.240 --> 06:54.160
Yes.

06:58.960 --> 07:00.360
Eighty…

07:01.040 --> 07:03.280
Eighty-eight.

07:10.600 --> 07:12.280
My lord. The Xilan Book is here.

07:42.080 --> 07:43.240
My lord!

08:09.520 --> 08:10.720
I see.

08:11.600 --> 08:13.720
Since the One Heart Curse is given,

08:13.800 --> 08:17.040
I will share the same joy, sorrow, death,

08:17.120 --> 08:18.800
and injury with the curse caster.

08:18.880 --> 08:21.320
Our bodies and minds
will be connected as one person.

08:22.600 --> 08:24.040
No matter what I do,

08:24.120 --> 08:26.200
she will not be affected.

08:26.840 --> 08:28.800
But I will feel

08:29.440 --> 08:31.400
whatever she feels.

08:31.480 --> 08:33.840
If someone wants to kill me,

08:33.919 --> 08:35.919
they can just kill her.

08:37.760 --> 08:39.080
That means…

08:39.159 --> 08:41.559
She is my biggest weakness now.

08:46.120 --> 08:48.400
Once the curse caster gives a command

08:48.480 --> 08:49.800
with the Xilan Holy Seal,

08:49.880 --> 08:51.800
I can't disobey it.

08:53.840 --> 08:55.560
How cruel.

08:57.080 --> 08:58.880
Am I going to be controlled

08:58.960 --> 09:01.120
by this plant

09:01.200 --> 09:04.040
from now on?

09:10.640 --> 09:11.840
My lord.

09:13.720 --> 09:14.720
My lord, please calm down.

09:15.440 --> 09:16.400
Based on my observation,

09:16.480 --> 09:18.240
even if this Xilan Curse
is strange and despicable,

09:18.720 --> 09:21.520
Little Flower Spirit doesn't seem to know
that she's from the Xilan Tribe.

09:22.280 --> 09:23.880
Even if she accidentally cast the curse,

09:24.400 --> 09:25.440
she doesn't know how to use it.

09:28.560 --> 09:29.800
Forget it.

09:30.680 --> 09:32.440
After she fixes the Destiny Book,

09:32.520 --> 09:34.080
I will be able to find

09:34.160 --> 09:36.520
the reincarnation spirit of Lady Chidi,

09:37.200 --> 09:38.640
unlock 100,000 demon soldiers,

09:38.720 --> 09:40.160
and destroy the Fairy Realm.

09:40.680 --> 09:42.400
It's just a Xilan Curse.

09:42.480 --> 09:44.320
I'll be able to break it by then.

09:47.080 --> 09:47.960
Yes.

09:58.800 --> 10:01.400
I'm so sleepy.

10:03.480 --> 10:04.520
Little Immortal Criminal.

10:04.600 --> 10:06.120
Why are you here?

10:06.200 --> 10:08.320
8,452.

10:09.080 --> 10:10.920
What?

10:11.480 --> 10:12.560
Your greenhouse

10:13.120 --> 10:15.760
has 8,452 flowers.

10:16.920 --> 10:17.760
You…

10:18.400 --> 10:20.320
You really counted
the flowers in the greenhouse?

10:20.400 --> 10:21.760
Yes.

10:22.800 --> 10:25.240
Is it because of what I said?

10:32.880 --> 10:34.320
I just said it casually.

10:34.400 --> 10:35.880
How could you take it seriously?

10:35.960 --> 10:38.160
Why are you so naive?

10:39.880 --> 10:41.000
Remember.

10:41.640 --> 10:42.600
Every word you say

10:42.680 --> 10:44.560
is very important to me.

10:44.640 --> 10:47.400
You can't say things casually from now on.

10:53.720 --> 10:54.680
Well,

10:54.760 --> 10:57.840
I'm just an ordinary plant.

10:57.920 --> 11:00.400
No one takes my words seriously.

11:00.480 --> 11:02.640
Since my master left to go traveling,

11:02.720 --> 11:04.920
no one cared about me.

11:05.000 --> 11:06.640
So you don't have to…

11:09.400 --> 11:10.240
Forget it.

11:10.320 --> 11:11.440
Very good.

11:12.520 --> 11:13.680
Go and fix the Destiny Book.

11:14.160 --> 11:15.480
Fix the Destiny Book?

11:17.600 --> 11:18.920
What does it matter to him

11:19.000 --> 11:20.520
whether I fix the Destiny Book or not?

11:20.600 --> 11:22.120
He's not my master.

11:22.200 --> 11:23.600
Why is he telling me what to do?

11:24.720 --> 11:26.800
He must want to have a conversation.

11:26.880 --> 11:28.880
It's rare to have some free time.
I won't do it.

11:29.680 --> 11:31.240
I'm hungry. I'm going to have breakfast.

11:34.640 --> 11:35.800
Breakfast?

11:36.320 --> 11:38.120
Do you still want to eat breakfast?

11:38.200 --> 11:40.120
Don't you know
that it's already nine o'clock?

11:40.960 --> 11:42.080
You don't cultivate

11:42.160 --> 11:44.160
and do what you need to.

11:44.240 --> 11:46.440
You wake up so late every day

11:46.520 --> 11:48.480
and you want to pass
the immortal examination?

11:49.040 --> 11:50.040
What do you know?

11:50.120 --> 11:52.000
If I don't sleep well,
how can I have energy?

11:52.080 --> 11:54.760
Sleeping is the first priority
for those who cultivate.

11:56.280 --> 11:57.640
In the three realms,

11:57.720 --> 11:59.240
I have never seen

11:59.320 --> 12:01.360
a lazy woman like you.

12:02.000 --> 12:02.960
You…

12:09.160 --> 12:10.000
See?

12:10.080 --> 12:11.000
Am I not right?

12:11.080 --> 12:12.560
How can you have strength
if you don't eat?

12:12.640 --> 12:15.400
Eating is the first priority
for people who cultivate too.

12:22.760 --> 12:23.600
Is it good?

12:28.720 --> 12:30.360
The food outside

12:30.440 --> 12:32.280
is better than the ones here.

12:33.160 --> 12:34.120
It is better

12:34.200 --> 12:36.640
to have freedom in the right way.

12:36.720 --> 12:37.800
Am I right?

12:43.560 --> 12:45.880
By the way,
we've known each other for so long.

12:45.960 --> 12:47.360
I still don't know who you are

12:47.440 --> 12:48.520
and what your name is.

12:57.240 --> 12:58.920
My name

13:00.320 --> 13:01.160
is Dongfang…

13:02.440 --> 13:03.280
Qing…

13:06.720 --> 13:09.400
Did I catch a cold in Haishi yesterday?

13:13.600 --> 13:14.880
What did you say your name was?

13:18.120 --> 13:19.200
Dongfang Qiang?

13:27.200 --> 13:28.160
Don't be upset

13:28.240 --> 13:29.680
if I say this.

13:30.920 --> 13:32.680
The surname Dongfang is the same

13:33.680 --> 13:36.600
as the deceased Dongfang Qingcang.

13:37.480 --> 13:38.640
It's not good.

13:39.200 --> 13:41.800
The deceased Dongfang Qingcang?

13:42.640 --> 13:44.520
Yes. Don't you know?

13:46.520 --> 13:49.560
Do you not even know
the Battle of Two Tribes?

13:49.640 --> 13:50.960
Haven't you ever read books?

13:53.640 --> 13:55.200
What's important
is to fix the Destiny Book.

13:55.960 --> 13:56.880
Forget it.

13:56.960 --> 13:59.720
I won't argue with this lazy
and ignorant Little Flower Spirit.

14:00.520 --> 14:03.000
Daqiang, I'm not talking nonsense.

14:03.080 --> 14:04.320
Dongfang Qingcang

14:04.400 --> 14:05.760
is really evil.

14:05.840 --> 14:07.400
The Fairy Realm suffered a lot

14:07.480 --> 14:08.920
from him back then.

14:09.000 --> 14:12.160
So the word "Dongfang"
is very unlucky and ominous

14:12.640 --> 14:14.240
in the entire Yujing.

14:14.320 --> 14:15.960
No, in the entire Shuiyuntian.

14:16.040 --> 14:17.160
Is that so?

14:19.320 --> 14:20.520
Don't be sad.

14:20.600 --> 14:22.960
Your surname is from your parents.

14:23.040 --> 14:24.480
You can't choose it.

14:26.080 --> 14:27.280
You're already very lucky.

14:27.360 --> 14:29.360
At least you have a surname.

14:29.440 --> 14:30.600
I'm just an orchid.

14:30.680 --> 14:32.200
I have no parents

14:32.280 --> 14:33.840
and no surname.

14:35.840 --> 14:36.920
Do you not have a name?

14:38.840 --> 14:40.640
Everyone calls me Orchid.

14:40.720 --> 14:42.240
Although you are unlucky

14:42.320 --> 14:44.040
to have the same surname
as Dongfang Qingcang,

14:44.120 --> 14:46.720
you look much more handsome than him.

14:48.280 --> 14:49.600
You

14:49.680 --> 14:51.320
are short-sighted

14:51.400 --> 14:53.040
and only around 1,000 years old.

14:53.120 --> 14:56.200
Have you really met the strongest
in the three realms,

14:56.280 --> 14:58.840
the great Moon Supreme Dongfang Qingcang?

15:01.880 --> 15:03.240
I've never seen him.

15:03.320 --> 15:05.240
But it's written in the books.

15:05.320 --> 15:06.960
Dongfang Qingcang

15:07.040 --> 15:08.800
has a green face and fangs.

15:08.880 --> 15:10.240
His long hair drags on the floor

15:10.320 --> 15:12.400
and his hair is full of lice.

15:12.480 --> 15:15.160
I heard he never brushed his teeth
and bathed for thousands of years.

15:15.240 --> 15:16.440
He has bad breath.

15:16.520 --> 15:17.720
He was so disgusting.

15:23.440 --> 15:24.880
It's my fault.

15:24.960 --> 15:28.120
I shouldn't talk about these
disgusting things while you're eating.

15:28.840 --> 15:30.080
What I want to say

15:30.160 --> 15:32.600
is that you are much better than him.

15:33.480 --> 15:35.600
Do I have to thank you?

15:37.200 --> 15:38.360
There's no need.

15:38.440 --> 15:40.320
If you really remember my kindness,

15:40.400 --> 15:42.000
go back

15:43.320 --> 15:44.960
to where you should be.

15:45.040 --> 15:46.120
That's better than anything.

15:50.320 --> 15:52.400
Since you know the Moon Supreme so well,

15:52.480 --> 15:54.480
do you know what he likes to eat?

16:01.320 --> 16:03.720
What Dongfang Qingcang likes to eat most

16:04.520 --> 16:07.000
are fair and chubby little fairies

16:07.080 --> 16:09.960
with thin skin and tender meat like you.

16:10.040 --> 16:13.320
He ate 10,000 or 8,000 fairies.

16:14.000 --> 16:15.440
Boiled,

16:15.960 --> 16:17.280
roasted,

16:18.000 --> 16:19.640
fried, steamed,

16:19.720 --> 16:20.840
and

16:22.280 --> 16:23.560
raw.

16:43.760 --> 16:45.640
"Thirty thousand years ago,

16:45.720 --> 16:48.720
the Battle of Two Tribes
was extremely tragic.

16:49.520 --> 16:51.400
The God of War, Lady Chidi,

16:51.480 --> 16:53.120
had unparalleled valiance.

16:53.200 --> 16:56.360
She did her best to seal
100,000 demon soldiers with her death.

16:57.720 --> 17:00.520
Inspired by the heroic and fearless spirit
of the God of War,

17:00.600 --> 17:02.240
the immortals
fought against the enemy bravely!

17:02.320 --> 17:04.720
Dongfang Qingcang was utterly defeated,

17:04.800 --> 17:06.000
beaten black and blue,

17:06.079 --> 17:08.240
kneeling and begging for mercy!"

17:10.480 --> 17:11.359
Enough!

17:21.720 --> 17:23.440
What are you doing, Daqiang?

17:23.520 --> 17:25.040
"Beaten black and blue,

17:25.599 --> 17:26.880
kneeling and begging for mercy"?

17:27.440 --> 17:29.400
Is that what's in the history books
of Shuiyuntian?

17:30.960 --> 17:32.560
Are you struggling with this?

17:33.440 --> 17:35.960
Of course the books don't say that much.

17:36.040 --> 17:37.480
Distorting historical facts.

17:38.160 --> 17:40.880
No wonder you can't even pass
a minor immortal examination.

17:41.400 --> 17:43.080
What do you know?

17:43.160 --> 17:46.000
There's only a little bit
of boring stuff in the history books.

17:46.080 --> 17:47.880
If I want to pass
the immortal examination,

17:47.960 --> 17:50.040
I have to use these figures of speech

17:50.120 --> 17:52.800
to describe the intense situation vividly

17:52.880 --> 17:54.560
at that time.

17:58.200 --> 17:59.720
Did you

18:00.720 --> 18:02.120
make up all these details?

18:03.120 --> 18:04.040
Yes.

18:04.120 --> 18:05.240
I made it up.

18:05.320 --> 18:07.120
How is it? Isn't it vivid?

18:13.560 --> 18:14.800
Why is a little plant

18:14.880 --> 18:16.880
reading about fighting all day long?

18:16.960 --> 18:18.000
Read something else.

18:22.640 --> 18:23.760
Right.

18:23.840 --> 18:26.160
Soon, the festival is coming.

18:27.800 --> 18:30.160
I'll listen to you.
I'll read something without fighting.

18:50.520 --> 18:52.440
This festival celebrates
the Fairy Tribe's victory

18:52.520 --> 18:55.240
in the Battle of Two Tribes.

18:55.320 --> 18:57.600
Shuiyuntian celebrates
the victory of the battle

18:57.680 --> 18:59.440
and the sealing of Moon Supreme

18:59.520 --> 19:00.880
on that day.

19:09.200 --> 19:10.120
What are you doing?

19:10.200 --> 19:11.560
You scared me.

19:11.640 --> 19:12.640
Daqiang.

19:12.720 --> 19:15.320
You don't have to use that much strength
to make festival pastries.

19:16.280 --> 19:17.320
Festival?

19:19.200 --> 19:20.280
Pastries?

19:20.360 --> 19:21.200
Yes.

19:21.280 --> 19:23.720
It's all right if you don't know
how to make it. I'll teach you.

19:23.800 --> 19:25.360
Take your time. Look.

19:25.440 --> 19:27.320
Pound the glutinous rice

19:28.040 --> 19:30.880
very hard like this.

19:32.920 --> 19:34.920
Pound it hard like this

19:35.000 --> 19:37.240
to make a paste.

19:37.320 --> 19:39.440
Then we can make pastry later.

19:39.520 --> 19:41.160
Look.

19:43.640 --> 19:44.680
See?

19:45.320 --> 19:46.720
Be careful.

19:46.800 --> 19:48.080
Watch out.

19:51.600 --> 19:53.160
It's hot!

19:58.240 --> 19:59.720
Why is it so hot?

20:03.760 --> 20:05.440
Don't grab it with your hands from now on.

20:05.520 --> 20:07.160
You can't even think of a way
not to get burned.

20:07.240 --> 20:08.120
You're stupid indeed.

20:10.960 --> 20:12.040
What do you know?

20:12.120 --> 20:14.120
The next step is the important one.

20:35.560 --> 20:36.840
It really looks like him.

20:37.720 --> 20:38.760
Like what?

20:38.840 --> 20:40.920
Dongfang Qingcang.

20:41.000 --> 20:44.680
Look, he has a green face and fangs,

20:44.760 --> 20:46.200
showing his teeth and claws.

20:47.040 --> 20:49.120
It's so funny.

20:51.240 --> 20:52.440
Right. This one.

20:53.800 --> 20:57.440
This is the Shuofeng Sword
of the God of War, Lady Chidi.

20:57.520 --> 21:01.440
Thrust it into Dongfang Qingcang here.

21:01.520 --> 21:02.440
Then keep twisting it.

21:05.480 --> 21:06.680
Stop!

21:23.840 --> 21:25.000
I mean,

21:26.240 --> 21:27.160
you're wrong.

21:28.080 --> 21:30.760
Lady Chidi killed herself
with Shuofeng Sword.

21:34.840 --> 21:36.920
You don't have to be so mean.

21:37.680 --> 21:38.800
Isn't it enough

21:38.880 --> 21:40.840
for the meaning and plot to be similar?

21:40.920 --> 21:42.120
How can it just be similar?

21:42.200 --> 21:44.960
Lady Chidi never really defeated
Dongfang Qingcang.

21:45.040 --> 21:46.600
Fine.

21:46.680 --> 21:48.840
Whatever you say.

21:50.280 --> 21:51.200
By the way,

21:52.000 --> 21:55.040
didn't you say that you don't know
what the Battle of Two Tribes is?

21:55.120 --> 21:57.640
How do you know these trivial details?

21:57.720 --> 21:59.960
These are not trivial details.

22:03.320 --> 22:04.480
Forget it.

22:08.920 --> 22:10.920
When you went to get your stuff just now,

22:11.000 --> 22:13.520
I had already read all the books there.

22:16.680 --> 22:18.120
I saw the torn portrait

22:18.200 --> 22:19.280
in the book too.

22:25.880 --> 22:27.080
Who is that?

22:27.800 --> 22:29.200
Why are you nervous?

22:29.280 --> 22:30.640
I'm not.

22:30.720 --> 22:31.920
I…

22:32.000 --> 22:33.160
You… I…

22:33.240 --> 22:34.600
I just feel so hot.

22:35.160 --> 22:37.080
By the way, I haven't had time

22:37.160 --> 22:38.800
to sun my master's liquor yet.

22:38.880 --> 22:40.000
I have to go sun the liquor.

22:52.040 --> 22:53.880
Little Flower Spirit.

22:53.960 --> 22:57.200
How much longer are you going
to put off fixing the Destiny Book?

22:59.880 --> 23:01.320
My lord, are you all right?

23:02.320 --> 23:04.920
I've wasted the whole day
with Little Flower Spirit.

23:05.000 --> 23:07.600
Fixing the Destiny Book
is postponed until tomorrow.

23:09.400 --> 23:10.440
My lord, please calm down.

23:12.040 --> 23:14.800
The Destiny Book of Lady Chidi's
primordial spirit is in your hands now.

23:15.600 --> 23:17.480
It's in the bag.

23:17.560 --> 23:18.720
There is no need to rush.

23:19.280 --> 23:22.120
Little Flower Spirit
doesn't know the power of the Xilan Curse,

23:22.200 --> 23:25.360
yet she controlled me like a fool.

23:25.440 --> 23:26.720
If she knew,

23:26.800 --> 23:28.880
wouldn't I really become her servant then?

23:29.720 --> 23:31.040
In the three realms,

23:31.640 --> 23:32.720
I don't believe

23:32.800 --> 23:35.880
there is no way to break the Xilan Curse.

23:37.320 --> 23:38.680
- Shangque.
- Yes.

23:42.440 --> 23:44.000
Go get the Heart-Hiding Hairpin.

23:44.080 --> 23:45.440
You must be careful

23:45.520 --> 23:46.880
not to be noticed.

23:47.400 --> 23:49.280
I will surely do my best.

23:50.280 --> 23:52.320
Once I break the curse,

23:53.200 --> 23:55.840
I will kill Little Flower Spirit.

23:57.720 --> 23:58.560
Wait.

24:00.160 --> 24:02.320
Prepare some water. I want to take a bath.

24:02.920 --> 24:03.760
Yes.

24:05.200 --> 24:06.280
What?

24:29.800 --> 24:32.360
The Arbiter Hall
has not been so lively for a long time.

24:32.440 --> 24:34.240
Although Daqiang

24:34.320 --> 24:36.920
always loses his temper,

24:37.000 --> 24:38.520
isn't that bright,

24:39.080 --> 24:41.000
and always refers to himself so highly,

24:42.000 --> 24:43.720
I don't think he is bad.

24:44.560 --> 24:46.800
Although his power is stronger than mine,

24:47.720 --> 24:49.120
it's not a big deal.

24:50.120 --> 24:53.520
He probably did not make a big mistake.

24:53.600 --> 24:56.160
It's pitiful that he has been
in the Haotian Tower

24:56.240 --> 24:57.640
for so long.

24:58.880 --> 24:59.800
Now,

25:00.320 --> 25:02.600
he's able to live freely.

25:33.720 --> 25:36.040
You've been resting for so long.
Why can't you fix it yet?

25:37.720 --> 25:39.440
Why are you staring at me?

25:39.520 --> 25:40.640
If you stare at me like this,

25:40.720 --> 25:41.960
how can I focus?

25:44.680 --> 25:46.240
I won't watch you. Just fix it.

26:14.280 --> 26:15.520
Are you all right?

26:15.600 --> 26:16.520
I'm fine.

26:16.600 --> 26:18.400
I'm good at fixing Destiny Books.

26:18.480 --> 26:20.640
But this Destiny Book is too bad.

26:20.720 --> 26:23.040
I've never fixed
such a broken Destiny Book before.

26:23.120 --> 26:24.560
It's a bit hard.

26:43.120 --> 26:44.000
Hey.

27:09.960 --> 27:11.160
My lord,

27:11.240 --> 27:13.320
Little Flower Spirit's power
is badly consumed.

27:13.920 --> 27:16.680
Maybe it's because she almost touched
the seal in Haotian Tower

27:16.760 --> 27:17.880
and consumed her power.

27:18.680 --> 27:20.440
Now,

27:20.960 --> 27:23.120
we're forcing her to fix the Destiny Book.

27:23.200 --> 27:24.440
That's why she fainted.

27:25.920 --> 27:27.480
In her current condition,

27:28.240 --> 27:29.600
when will she be able to fix it?

27:29.680 --> 27:30.600
My lord.

27:31.360 --> 27:33.400
A Destiny Book is formed by
the spiritual energy of heaven and earth.

27:33.480 --> 27:35.120
It contains the karma of everything.

27:35.600 --> 27:38.800
- If we want to fix it, first, we must--
- What do you want to say?

27:39.440 --> 27:41.120
Before she fully recovers,

27:41.680 --> 27:43.120
I'm afraid there is no way to fix it.

27:46.840 --> 27:49.000
When will she fully recover then?

27:50.600 --> 27:51.640
One day?

27:51.720 --> 27:53.000
Two days?

27:54.640 --> 27:56.000
Do you want me

27:56.080 --> 27:58.000
to wait for ten days or a half month?

28:00.120 --> 28:01.040
My lord,

28:01.120 --> 28:03.240
I only know a little
about Chinese medicine.

28:03.320 --> 28:04.920
Little Flower Spirit is from Xilan Tribe.

28:05.000 --> 28:06.160
She must have a special physique.

28:06.680 --> 28:09.120
All I know is that she needs
to have a good rest now.

28:09.200 --> 28:11.280
As to when she will fully recover,

28:11.360 --> 28:12.320
I don't know.

28:13.320 --> 28:15.080
Forget about ten days or a half month…

28:16.120 --> 28:17.000
Say it.

28:18.840 --> 28:21.000
It might take 3, 5, or 100 years.

28:23.440 --> 28:24.520
That is

28:25.720 --> 28:26.800
a possibility.

29:00.560 --> 29:01.640
My lord,

29:01.720 --> 29:02.880
even if you have great power,

29:02.960 --> 29:04.960
you can't keep spending it like this.

29:05.040 --> 29:05.920
I know what to do.

29:06.560 --> 29:07.400
Go back to your work.

29:08.400 --> 29:09.520
You don't have to stay with me.

29:09.600 --> 29:10.760
My lord.

29:10.840 --> 29:11.720
I don't understand.

29:11.800 --> 29:14.200
Who is this Immortal Pill made for?

29:14.280 --> 29:15.320
What medicine

29:15.400 --> 29:17.000
is worth all your effort?

29:18.240 --> 29:20.000
What he's guarding isn't a pill,

29:20.680 --> 29:24.080
but his sincerity.

29:24.160 --> 29:25.560
Sincerity?

29:27.160 --> 29:30.080
A few thousand-year-old child shouldn't
ask about things he shouldn't know.

29:32.520 --> 29:35.040
My lord, you can't guard this forever.

29:35.120 --> 29:36.680
How about I guard it for you?

29:36.760 --> 29:37.840
Don't worry.

29:37.920 --> 29:39.600
I won't fail you.

29:42.880 --> 29:43.840
Qingchuan,

29:44.440 --> 29:46.400
it's rare for me to visit the Fairy Realm.

29:46.480 --> 29:48.640
Why don't we find a place
to have some tea?

29:48.720 --> 29:49.640
Tell me

29:49.720 --> 29:52.240
about the interesting things
in Yujing recently.

29:53.080 --> 29:54.880
- But--
- Let's go.

29:54.960 --> 29:56.440
Lord Ronghao, let go of me!

29:56.520 --> 29:57.880
I want to stay with my lord.

30:07.120 --> 30:10.760
FIVE HUNDRED YEARS AGO

30:10.840 --> 30:11.720
You're awake.

30:14.920 --> 30:16.360
Don't get up.

30:16.440 --> 30:17.640
You're badly injured.

30:17.720 --> 30:18.600
You can't move.

30:19.320 --> 30:21.320
Unfortunately, my power is weak.

30:21.400 --> 30:22.920
I can only help you
stop the bleeding first.

30:23.000 --> 30:24.080
Thank you, fairy.

30:25.080 --> 30:26.120
I'm sorry to bother you.

30:28.320 --> 30:31.040
Actually, I'm not considered a fairy yet.

30:31.120 --> 30:33.760
I just transformed into a human form.

30:33.840 --> 30:35.360
I don't even have a name.

30:36.320 --> 30:37.720
Do you have a name?

30:39.120 --> 30:40.200
Don't you know me?

30:41.320 --> 30:43.040
I don't know anyone

30:43.120 --> 30:44.760
except my master.

30:44.840 --> 30:46.560
I don't have any friends either.

31:05.000 --> 31:06.440
Lord Changheng!

31:06.960 --> 31:08.520
I'll surely pass the immortal examination.

31:08.600 --> 31:10.840
I will definitely enter
the Fountain Palace!

31:32.000 --> 31:33.120
My lord, you can't do this.

31:33.200 --> 31:34.800
Disturbing the natural law and karma

31:34.880 --> 31:36.240
might destroy your body and spirit.

31:37.800 --> 31:39.200
Disturb the natural law?

31:39.280 --> 31:41.880
Haven't I disturbed
a lot of natural laws already?

32:08.120 --> 32:09.040
My lord.

32:09.120 --> 32:11.040
Only Arbiter can pry
into a Destiny Book's secret.

32:11.120 --> 32:12.640
It's hard to find her now.

32:12.720 --> 32:15.000
The success and failure
still depend on Arbiter's disciple,

32:15.080 --> 32:16.240
Little Flower Spirit.

32:17.320 --> 32:19.840
But I'm finding a way
to break the Xilan Curse now,

32:19.920 --> 32:21.320
so I can't stay in Shuiyuntian for long.

32:22.200 --> 32:23.840
I'm afraid

32:24.680 --> 32:25.840
you can only

32:26.400 --> 32:28.320
look after her yourself.

32:40.320 --> 32:41.160
Forget it.

32:42.400 --> 32:43.920
It shouldn't be hard

32:44.000 --> 32:45.840
to take care of a plant.

32:52.840 --> 32:54.320
"Xilan Plant

32:54.400 --> 32:56.480
was born in the secret realm of Xilan.

32:56.560 --> 32:59.040
It likes warmth
and dislikes severe cold weather.

32:59.600 --> 33:01.040
It likes a place with partial shade

33:01.120 --> 33:03.040
and dislikes sun exposure.

33:03.120 --> 33:05.360
It likes the first rays of sunshine

33:05.440 --> 33:06.880
from the east in the morning.

33:06.960 --> 33:10.400
Except during the Spring Equinox,
Tomb-Sweeping Day, and Grain Rain,

33:10.480 --> 33:12.360
you can't move its roots."

33:22.280 --> 33:24.880
"If it's dry and lacks water,

33:24.960 --> 33:27.440
the roots will shrink and dry out

33:28.240 --> 33:30.480
and the leaves will be burned and curled.

33:31.280 --> 33:33.600
Then it will develop badly

33:33.680 --> 33:35.680
and its spiritual wisdom
will be hard to open.

33:39.400 --> 33:42.600
Xilan Plant is very pure.

33:42.680 --> 33:44.200
If its spirit develops,

33:44.280 --> 33:46.440
it needs to be watered
with rootless water.

33:46.520 --> 33:50.040
The best time of the day
is from 5:00 a.m. to 7:00 a.m.

33:50.720 --> 33:52.000
Avoid overwatering

33:52.080 --> 33:55.400
to prevent waterlogging,
resulting in rotten roots and leaves."

33:59.440 --> 34:00.640
What is rootless water?

34:01.920 --> 34:02.880
Saliva?

34:02.960 --> 34:04.200
Sweat?

34:04.280 --> 34:05.120
Tears?

34:13.280 --> 34:15.360
"Heavenly water is rootless

34:15.440 --> 34:17.239
and born from the morning dew."

34:18.480 --> 34:20.159
It's morning dew.

34:21.320 --> 34:22.639
How ridiculous!

34:22.719 --> 34:24.880
Do I have to catch it for her
drop by drop?

34:28.719 --> 34:29.719
No way.

34:35.360 --> 34:36.199
My lord.

34:37.080 --> 34:38.040
But the Destiny Book--

34:38.120 --> 34:40.440
If it weren't for the Destiny Book
and the One Heart Curse,

34:40.520 --> 34:42.120
I would have killed her long ago.

34:48.560 --> 34:51.480
She wants me to serve her?

34:54.560 --> 34:55.960
No way.

36:25.560 --> 36:26.920
How strange.

36:27.960 --> 36:28.840
Daqiang.

36:31.200 --> 36:32.040
Daqiang.

36:59.200 --> 37:00.880
Where did this idiot come from?

37:05.400 --> 37:06.320
Run!

37:06.400 --> 37:07.800
The look in his eyes is so fierce!

37:13.040 --> 37:13.960
Daqiang.

37:14.920 --> 37:15.800
Daqiang.

37:18.360 --> 37:19.200
Daqiang.

37:40.240 --> 37:42.280
How long do I have to wait?

37:43.040 --> 37:45.120
Once I break the curse,

37:45.200 --> 37:47.880
I'll kill the damn Little Flower Spirit,

37:47.960 --> 37:49.400
burn the greenhouse,

37:49.480 --> 37:51.320
destroy the Shuiyuntian,

37:51.400 --> 37:53.640
break the bones of Lord Yunzhong,

37:53.720 --> 37:55.000
and soak them in liquor.

37:56.480 --> 37:58.120
ARBITER HALL

38:02.160 --> 38:04.240
My lord!

38:04.320 --> 38:05.280
I finally found you.

38:06.200 --> 38:08.280
Lord Yunzhong is summoning you
for a meeting at Yunzhong Water Pavilion.

38:09.800 --> 38:10.680
I'll go later.

38:11.600 --> 38:12.440
But

38:12.520 --> 38:15.440
Lord Yunzhong especially instructed
that you hurry and not delay.

38:29.920 --> 38:30.800
Daqiang.

38:35.480 --> 38:38.040
ARBITER HALL

38:47.000 --> 38:48.520
Where is he?

38:53.280 --> 38:54.880
He's usually always around.

38:54.960 --> 38:56.200
Where exactly did he go?

39:00.040 --> 39:03.480
Could he have left?

39:04.920 --> 39:05.880
That's great.

39:06.720 --> 39:07.920
He's gone!

39:08.520 --> 39:10.480
Creeper, Succulents, Holly, Peach.

39:10.560 --> 39:11.440
Stop hiding.

39:11.520 --> 39:12.920
He's really gone.

39:13.000 --> 39:14.240
Come out.

39:14.760 --> 39:16.920
If you don't come out,
I will take your spirit stones.
